					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "USB2.0 Type-C receptacle, 16 pin / 12 pad. GT-USB-7010ASV, G-Switch, LCSC C2988369 - Extended library, economy-eligible, ~$0.087 (half the HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12). Footprint is KiCad's exact match for this MPN. NOT pad-identical to HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 despite sharing the topology: signal pads sit 0.32mm lower (y -3.725 vs -4.045) and 0.21mm shorter (1.24 vs 1.45), the four outer 0.6mm pads are 0.05mm tighter, and the lower shield slot is 1.8 vs 1.6mm - so do not substitute the two footprints. A1+B12 / A4+B9 / A9+B4 / A12+B1 are bridged in the part, giving 12 pads for 16 logical pins. ENIG recommended - 0.5mm-pitch USB-C wants a flat finish."
			(at 29.21 39.37 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
